{"text": "Kingsport Times News\n\nNovenber 21,\nPage \u201cA\n\n1995\n\ncont. page 9-A...\n\nArchie Bailey fires up a cigarette Monday as Ht\ntobacco farmers opposed to proposed federal regu:\n\nlarry Arnold speaks at a rally,\nn of their crop.\n\nin Abingdon for\n\nArea farmers rally against\nfederal tobacco regulations\n\nBy SHARON CASKEY HAYES\n\u2018Times-News Business Editor\n\nABINGDON, Va. \u2014 Proposed federal tobae-\nco regulations cast a shadow over the opening\nof the burley tobacco market here Monday. To-\nbacco advocate Archie Bailey called the regu-\nlations \u201cjust another intrusion in our personal\nives.\u201d\n\u201cPDA (Food and Drug Administration)\n\u2018wants to regulate tobacco like'a drug. If we al-\nlow them to get away with tbis, what's to keep\nthem from regulating our diets, even? If we al-\nlow them to get their foot in the door, they will\n\u2018be out on your farm, checking your tobacco\ncrops to see what you're doing.\n\u2018*Ye's just another intrusion in our personal\nlives,\u201d said Bailey, who is ehairman of the\nBurley Committee of Virginia.\nBailey and other tobacco officials were on\nhand for the start of the tobacco selling season\nat the Southwest Tobacco Warehouse in\nAbingdon,\n\u2018ay Poole, director of government and com-\nmunity relations for Philip Morris USA, told\n\nabout 100 farmers gathered for the event that\nthe proposed federal regulations are simply\nabout politics.\nHe said the FDA wants the public to be-\nlieve the issue involves smpking among the\ncountry\u2019s youth.\n\u201cThis isn't about youth sinoking. It\u2019s about\npolitics,\u201d Poole said,\nHe said FDA Commissioner Dr. David\nKessler has \u201casserted that nicotine is a highly\naddictive drug, and that a cigarette or chewing\ntobaeco is a nicotine delivery device.\u201d\n\u201cWell, I think it's important to make one\npoint here, A scalpel is a medical device, this\nis not,\u201d said Poole, holding up a leaf of tobac-\nco.\nNobody wants kids to smoke \u2014 not Dr.\nKessler, not Philip Morris and the tobacco\ncompanies, none of you farmers here want\nKids to smoke,\" he said, \u201cBut what we do think\nis important is that we keep FDA off the\nfarm.\u201d\nPoole said that Kessler and the FDA are\n\nPlease see AREA, page 9A\n\nLECVOELE IG", "words": [{"text": "Kingsport", "x0": 304, "y0": 83, "x1": 366, "y1": 96, "conf": 90.0}, {"text": "Times", "x0": 373, "y0": 83, "x1": 407, "y1": 93, "conf": 90.0}, {"text": "News", "x0": 415, "y0": 83, "x1": 442, "y1": 93, "conf": 96.0}, {"text": "Novenber", "x0": 303, "y0": 97, "x1": 360, "y1": 108, "conf": 92.0}, {"text": "21,", "x0": 367, "y0": 97, "x1": 385, "y1": 110, "conf": 72.0}, {"text": "Page", "x0": 305, "y0": 112, "x1": 332, "y1": 123, "conf": 90.0}, {"text": "\u201cA", "x0": 342, "y0": 111, "x1": 361, "y1": 120, "conf": 35.0}, {"text": "1995", "x0": 395, "y0": 97, "x1": 421, "y1": 108, "conf": 85.0}, {"text": "cont.", "x0": 305, "y0": 126, "x1": 337, "y1": 135, "conf": 95.0}, {"text": "page", "x0": 346, "y0": 127, "x1": 373, "y1": 137, "conf": 93.0}, {"text": "9-A...", "x0": 381, "y0": 124, "x1": 420, "y1": 134, "conf": 17.0}, {"text": "Archie", "x0": 128, "y0": 504, "x1": 168, "y1": 514, "conf": 89.0}, {"text": "Bailey", "x0": 172, "y0": 503, "x1": 208, "y1": 514, "conf": 96.0}, {"text": "fires", "x0": 213, "y0": 503, "x1": 238, "y1": 512, "conf": 96.0}, {"text": "up", "x0": 243, "y0": 505, "x1": 256, "y1": 514, "conf": 96.0}, {"text": "a", "x0": 261, "y0": 505, "x1": 266, "y1": 512, "conf": 89.0}, {"text": "cigarette", "x0": 270, "y0": 502, "x1": 322, "y1": 513, "conf": 89.0}, {"text": "Monday", "x0": 326, "y0": 500, "x1": 370, "y1": 511, "conf": 96.0}, {"text": "as", "x0": 375, "y0": 502, "x1": 385, "y1": 509, "conf": 96.0}, {"text": "Ht", "x0": 390, "y0": 499, "x1": 398, "y1": 509, "conf": 34.0}, {"text": "tobacco", "x0": 129, "y0": 517, "x1": 171, "y1": 527, "conf": 86.0}, {"text": "farmers", "x0": 176, "y0": 516, "x1": 220, "y1": 526, "conf": 